AI Storyboard Generator using Gemini + Image Generation

Turn a written story or script into a visual storyboard automatically.

Features:

Generate scenes from a story

Create scene descriptions and camera angles

Generate character actions and expressions

Arrange scenes into storyboard panels

Export storyboard as PDF/image

Gemini-powered story analysis

Tech stack: Python, Gemini API, FastAPI/Streamlit, image-generation API
